                                                                                                                 poly-
                                                                                                         3    n
                                                   nomials and Vieta’s formulas with O      u=1 p(u, ≤ k) + k n com-
                                                   plexity, where p(u, ≤ k) counts the number of partitions of a positive
                                                   integer u into at most k parts. The latter constructs an n-th de-
