β can be determined, hence we may get the value of Pp with its range known.


5      Conclusion and future work
Conclusion In this paper, we present two deterministic algorithms (Algorithm
1 and Algorithm 2) for solving the (n, k)-complete HSSP. A comparison of the
algorithms for solving HSSP is provided as follows:

